favicon.ico?favicon.0f11slezv2usp.ico\" sizes=\"64x64\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png?icon.1cgd0ajnqb464.png\" sizes=\"64x64\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png?apple-icon.1jxsl_4g54s9g.png\" sizes=\"180x180\" type=\"image/png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"flex-1 bg-[#161d18] text-neutral-200\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-emerald-400\">project_os // coming soon</p><h1 class=\"mt-6 font-mono text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl\">The operating system<br/>for <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">open source</span>.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-400\">Publish your projects. Fork each other&#x27;s work. Every fork joins a public family tree — <span class=\"text-neutral-200\">Subwolf</span><span class=\"text-emerald-400\"> // </span><span class=\"text-neutral-200\">Cyber</span> — and the best lineages rise. Built for vibe coders, new and professional.</p><ul class=\"mt-10 space-y-3 text-sm text-neutral-400\"><li><span class=\"font-mono text-emerald-400\">▸</span> Everything open source. Nothing sold here. Code lives on GitHub.</li><li><span class=\"font-mono text-emerald-400\">▸</span> Every project ships AI continuation instructions — any coding AI can pick it up cold and keep evolving it.</li><li><span class=\"font-mono text-emerald-400\">▸</span> Lineage trees, likes, and Fork Wars: the most-forked projects wear the crown.</li></ul><div class=\"mt-12\"><form class=\"flex max-w-md gap-2\"><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" class=\"flex-1 rounded border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-800 px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm text-white placeholder-neutral-600 outline-none focus:border-emerald-400\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"rounded bg-emerald-400 px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-black transition hover:bg-emerald-300 disabled:opacity-50\">Join waitlist</button></form><p class=\"mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400\">No spam. One email when the doors open.</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 border-t border-neutral-700 pt-8\"><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-400\">Launch sections</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 border-emerald-400/30\">Claude Code</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-fuchsia-400 border-fuchsia-400/30\">Claude Skills</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-amber-400 border-amber-400/30\">CLAUDE.md</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 border-emerald-400/30\">MCP Servers</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-sky-400 border-sky-400/30\">Codex</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-violet-400 border-violet-400/30\">Local LLMs</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-lime-400 border-lime-400/30\">Scripts &amp; Tools</span><span class=\"rounded border bg-neutral-800/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs text-rose-400 border-rose-400/30\">Games</span></div></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0-v1dsbzad4aq.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1tt51e-n9ydqe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1tt51e-n9ydqe.js